                                  </TooltipTrigger>
                                  <TooltipContent>Awaiting quotation</TooltipContent>
                                </Tooltip>
                              )}
                            </td>
                            {/* FOUR RUNGS, and the row says which it is on: no
                                partner yet, not asked, asked, taken, priced.
                                Only the first rung is an action — the rest are
